MODIFIED FILES


    read_params.f90:
    - added variable 'output_dir' to namelist block 'output_params'
    - added TRIM(output_dir) to info_file strings where appropriate
    - added variable 'print_when_io' to namelist block 'run_params'
    - added variable 'ic_tag_name' to namelist block 'dice_params'

    NOTE: These new variables must be declared before the corresponding namelist block


    init_flow_fine.f90:
    - multiply IG_metal by ic_scale_metal to have freedom in the adopted units


    init_part.f90:
    - added TRIM(output_dir) to fileloc strings
    - split all if-clauses of the form:
          if(star.or.sink)then [ or if(star)then ]
        	if(metal)then
        	endif
          endif
     into
          if(star.or.sink)then  [ or if(star)then ]
          endif
          if(metal)then
          endif

    NOTE: There were three [one] such clauses
    IMPORTANT: beware of the allocate/deallocate statements and loops

    - added family tag, previously set to 0 by default, now set to the value specified by the ICs (if available); requires changes to read_params.f90 (see above).


    particle_tree.f90:
    - split all if-clauses of the form:
          if(star.or.sink)then
        	if(metal)then
        	endif
          endif
     into
          if(star.or.sink)then
          endif
          if(metal)then
          endif

    NOTE: There were three such clauses
    IMPORTANT: beware of loops, #ifdef directives, and logic flow


    add_list.f90:
    - split all if-clauses of the form:
          if(star.or.sink)then
        	if(metal)then
        	endif
          endif
     into
          if(star.or.sink)then
          endif
          if(metal)then
          endif

    NOTE: There were two such clauses
    IMPORTANT: beware of loops
